      en: ["Ghayathi is located about 250 kilometers west of Abu Dhabi city.", "The town has a population of approximately 14,000 residents.", "It is a key logistical hub for road transport toward the Saudi border.", "Ghayathi features a modern hospital with more than 50 beds.", "The region is known for date palm cultivation in desert conditions.", "The Bida Al-Mutawa archaeological site is located near the town."],
